If a patient has a high-pain-related-anxiety then every clinician may refer the patient to a mental-health-specialist for a treatment.
If a patient has a high-pain-related-fear then every clinician may refer the patient to a mental-health-specialist for a treatment.
If a patient has a clinically-significant-psychological-distress then every clinician may refer the patient to a mental-health-specialist for a treatment.
A mental-health-specialist-example includes a psychologist-example and includes a psychiatrist-example and includes a clinical-social-worker-example.
